                     alt="Retrato del creador Marko Sebastian Orihuela Carrasco" />
                <span class="badge bg-dark bg-opacity-75 text-warning border border-warning-subtle font-monospace position-absolute top-0 start-0 m-3 px-3 py-2">
                    <i class="bi bi-camera-fill me-1"></i> FOTO DE MUESTRA
                </span>
