                    <span class="badge bg-warning text-dark font-monospace fw-bold mb-1 px-2 py-1">AUTOR Y CREADOR</span>
                    <span class="d-block text-white fs-5 fw-bold">Marko Sebastian Orihuela Carrasco</span>
